> In game 2 of the Tovar Tussle at RHS The Rams jumped on the Eagles quickly and emphatically with a 3-spot in the top of the[ 1]st inning. The Eagles would counter with a single run and for the first few innings[ Friday] night both teams were in a punch counter-punch game. When the tally reached 5-5 the Eagles were able to fly away from the Rams ending the game in the[ 6]th[ inning] 16-6.

